    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      540.44,
      538.3,
      652.27
    ],
    "text": "Showery weather in the Southwestern parts of the island is likely to increase during the next few days starting from today (19th). Showers will occur at times in the Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya Districts. Heavy falls about 100 mm are likely at some places in western and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      656.47,
      537.89,
      698.62
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in Uva and Northern provinces and in Batticaloa and Ampara districts after 2.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      702.55,
      537.92,
      743.5
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
